{"name": "Nocthra", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"125\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026590/extras/fdfd989bc2f4fc474453481071b68467.avif?t=1787207414\" width=\"1560\"/></span><br/>In <strong>Nocthra</strong>, you play as a Necromancer accidentally awakened by villagers who shattered an ancient seal.  <br/>Defend yourself from the living, raise the dead, and strategically command chaos in a game infused with <strong>roguelike elements</strong>.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"125\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026590/extras/97fe5dd374309033148052ccb777dfb1.avif?t=1787207414\" width=\"1560\"/></span><br/><strong>Corpses</strong> are the Necromancer\u2019s greatest resource. Summon minions from fallen bodies or convert them into dark energy to fuel your rituals.  <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026590/extras/c238f8ad7c64aa73a1c0738c074de1fe.poster.avif?t=1787207414\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026590/extras/c238f8ad7c64aa73a1c0738c074de1fe.webm?t=1787207414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026590/extras/c238f8ad7c64aa73a1c0738c074de1fe.mp4?t=1787207414\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"125\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026590/extras/99e4ce141c58ede5d78a8b6c92bdeae4.avif?t=1787207414\" width=\"1560\"/></span><br/>Gather Dark Energy and unlock unique <strong>Sigils</strong> that empower your minions, alter the battlefield, and grant the Necromancer new abilities.  <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"878\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026590/extras/ecabacc421f1675b9bc0da1ec60ba282.poster.avif?t=1787207414\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026590/extras/ecabacc421f1675b9bc0da1ec60ba282.webm?t=1787207414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026590/extras/ecabacc421f1675b9bc0da1ec60ba282.mp4?t=1787207414\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/> </div>", "short_desc": "Nocthra is a grim retro-style game where you play as a necromancer defending waves of attackers by raising hordes of minions from fallen enemies\u2019 corpses. Protect your graveyard from relentless assaults, and dive into a perk system that offers endless skill combinations for infinite replayability.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026590/0cd16953166b7033996752a83a113fb25d4e46d6/header.jpg?t=1787207414", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Auto Battler", "Roguelike", "Dark Fantasy", "1990's", "Real Time Tactics"], "developers": "Flat Lab", "publishers": "Flat Lab", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4026590", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "17 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/uZpl3iqTcGQ", "first_seen": 1787672592.555697}